  1,Intake,Record game type reachable URL integration state source availability and key availability first
  2,Mode,Choose one primary mode: testability integration run report scenario-gap or ops
  3,Doctor,Run scripts/wai-play.sh doctor for a read-only python playwright chromium and env-key report
  4,Bridge,Statically check the integration file with scripts/check_integration.py before trusting any run
