  6,Report,Give weighted dimension scores and credibility diagnostics separately and merge duplicate problem cards
  7,Scenario,Map SCENARIO_PRECONDITION_MISSING LOADER_NOT_IMPLEMENTED UNSAFE_TO_JUMP and SERVER_AUTHORITATIVE_STATE to one correct response each
